    "updated_at": "2016-05-25T13:34:58Z",
    "body": "Ok, so step 12 of https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-redirect-fetch sets the request's origin to a globally unique value, so the referrer policy checks would always count as cross-origin after that. That makes sense.\n",
